<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","mainEntityOfPage":"https://ambcrypto.com/introducing-chaingpt-labs-a-new-venture-capital-and-incubation-arm-to-propel-web3-projects/","inLanguage":"en-US","headline":"Introducing ChainGPT Labs: A new venture capital and incubation arm to propel Web3 Projects","url":"https://ambcrypto.com/introducing-chaingpt-labs-a-new-venture-capital-and-incubation-arm-to-propel-web3-projects/","datePublished":"2024-07-09T03:15:13-04:00","dateModified":"2024-07-09T09:47:05-04:00","description":"ChainGPT is the leading provider of AI-powered Infrastructure for the crypto, blockchain, and Web3 industry.","keywords":"Press Release, crypto news","articleSection":"Press Release","wordCount":684,"articleBody":"ChainGPT is thrilled to announce the launch of ChainGPT Labs, its new venture capital and incubation arm dedicated to accelerating the growth and success of pioneering Web3 projects. With a robust array of resources and an expert team, ChainGPT Labs is poised to support innovative ventures from conception through to successful market launch. Venture Capital Investment and Funding Opportunities ChainGPT Labs will operate as a Web3 VC, offering investments ranging from $100k to $400k, along with additional lines of credit between $100k and $200k to accommodate the varying needs of Web3 projects. This funding initiative extends beyond the firm's incubation and acceleration programs, embracing a broader scope of promising ventures. Strategic Guidance and Marketing Expertise The team at ChainGPT Labs provides intensive guidance, meeting with projects one to two times weekly to forge robust market strategies, optimize token economics, and enhance outreach efforts. A substantial focus is placed on marketing, with investments of $50k to $150k in promotional activities during the incubation phase. This includes social media strategies, rebranding, website development, content creation, and forming influential partnerships. Comprehensive Incubation and Acceleration Programs ChainGPT Labs offers Crypto AI projects a 12-24 month incubation and acceleration program that encompasses: Tokenomics and Branding: Crafting strategies for market entry and ongoing growth, alongside branding and web design. PR and Marketing: Managing comprehensive PR strategies and advertisements across various platforms. Fundraising and Community Management: Overseeing fundraising activities and managing vibrant community interactions through platforms like Telegram and Discord. Business Development: Assisting projects in developing key partnerships and navigating exchange listings. Growth and Advisory: Offering continuous advisory support and strategy development to ensure sustained success post-launch. Distinguished Leadership Team ChainGPT Labs boasts a dedicated leadership team: Ilan Rakhmanov and Ariel Asafov, Co-Heads of Incubations Vlad Fila, Head of Administration Tomer Warschauer Nuni, Head of Investments Gintare Kairyte, VC Network Manager Nick Van Der Kolk, Ads & Marketing Manager Proven Track Record with Diverse Projects Already, ChainGPT Labs has supported a variety of projects in the Crypto AI field and beyond, from ChainGPT AI and ChainGPT Pad to dynamic ventures like AITech, DEXCheck, and Lumoz. Each project benefits from tailored support and strategic guidance aimed at fostering long-term success and innovation in the Web3 space. Testimonials \"ChainGPT Labs is the most professional, hardworking, and reliable team we have ever met in the Web3 space. We really recommend cooperating with ChainGPT as they are focused on delivering value to their partners.\" — Vlad, Co-founder GT-Protocol \"ChainGPT Labs are an incredible partner for us; they have the project interest at heart and provide valuable expertise based on their proven track record. The team are friendly, fun, and true professionals who are great to work with.\" — Nick, Founder Shieldeum \"I highly recommend ChainGPT Labs for any future projects seeking incubation. Their unparalleled expertise in the blockchain ecosystem and their strategic partnerships have been pivotal in our journey. The provided resources and networking opportunities are invaluable, allowing us to accelerate significantly.\" — Eitan Katz, Co-founder Kima Portfolio and Case Studies GT-Protocol [Incubation] Funds raised: $4,175,000 ChainGPT AI [Incubation] Funds raised: $2,032,400 AITech [Incubation] Funds raised: $6,960,400 DEXCheck [Incubation] Funds raised: $2,190,000 OMNIA Protocol [Incubation] Funds raised: $5,385,000 KIMA [Incubation] Funds raised: $7,340,500 Shieldeum [Incubation] Funds raised: $2,200,000 Cookie3 [Acceleration] Funds raised: $6,263,000 Engines of Fury [Acceleration] Funds raised: $5,700,000 ChainGPT Labs is committed to being the ultimate partner for Web3 projects, providing the tools, knowledge, and support necessary to thrive in a rapidly evolving digital landscape. Stay tuned for more updates and success stories from our team. About ChainGPT ChainGPT is the leading provider of AI-powered Infrastructure for the crypto, blockchain, and Web3 industry. The one-stop-shop Crypto AI hub. From automated smart contract generation and auditing to autonomous community management, advanced Web3 AI chatbot, AI-powered news aggregation, and NFT generation, ChainGPT is the most sophisticated, end-to-end AI solution on the market. General BD: Contact Person(s): Jacob Wallace / Chris Duggan / Sharon Sciammas Contact Email(s): jacob@chaingpt.org / chris@chaingpt.org / sharon@chaingpt.org ➡️To learn more about ChainGPT, visit the official ChainGPT.org website ➡️For all inquiries, please contact support@chaingpt.org  Disclaimer: This is a paid post and should not be treated as news/advice.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"AMBCrypto Team","url":"https://ambcrypto.com/author/ambcrypto-team/"},"publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","name":"AMBCrypto","url":"https://ambcrypto.com/","logo":{"@type":"