<p><b>Venture Capital Investment and Funding Opportunities</b></p>
<p><b></b><span style="font-weight: 400;">ChainGPT Labs will operate as a </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Web3 VC</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">, offering investments ranging from $100k to $400k, along with additional lines of credit between $100k and $200k to accommodate the varying needs of Web3 projects. This funding initiative extends beyond the firm&#8217;s incubation and acceleration programs, embracing a broader scope of promising ventures.</span></p>
<p><b>Strategic Guidance and Marketing Expertise</b></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The team at ChainGPT Labs provides intensive guidance, meeting with projects one to two times weekly to forge robust market strategies, optimize token economics, and enhance outreach efforts. A substantial focus is placed on marketing, with investments of $50k to $150k in promotional activities during the incubation phase. This includes social media strategies, rebranding, website development, content creation, and forming influential partnerships.</span></p>
